{"id":19,"cluster_id":"CL-017","conclusion":"No_EU_jurisdiction_use_member_state_law","forum":"德国法院（依德国国内法判断）","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":false,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.4(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.6(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.6(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.62(1)"}],"reasoning":"乙在任何欧盟成员国均无住所，且案情已排除消费者、雇佣、专属管辖及选择法院协议等例外；因此依 Art.6(1)，德国法院是否有管辖权转由德国国内法判断。甲住所位于德国，依 Art.6(2) 可在与德国国民相同条件下援用德国现行国内管辖规则。","missing_facts":[],"accepted_conclusions":["No_EU_jurisdiction_use_member_state_law"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.62(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.4(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.6(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.6(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.62(1)"],"review_source_stage":"D1_JOINT_RECONFIRMATION"}
