{"id":25,"cluster_id":"CL-023","conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":true,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.6"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.7(6)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.63(3)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.6(1)"}],"reasoning":"伦敦信托住所只有在相关时期英国受该条例约束且满足适用条件时才可能依 Art.7(6) 形成特别管辖；现有事实不足。","missing_facts":["缺少诉讼受理日期、拟起诉法院、受托人住所及《布鲁塞尔Ⅰ再述条例》对英国是否仍适用的事实。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Abstain_Insufficient_Info"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":[],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.6","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.7(6)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.63(3)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.6(1)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":26,"cluster_id":"CL-024","conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"西班牙法院","forum_type":"appearance","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.24"}],"reasoning":"在普通民商事案件中，乙就实体答辩且未抗辩管辖，西班牙法院可依 Art.26(1) 取得应诉管辖。Art.24 专属管辖与 Art.26(2) 的弱势方告知保障作为例外条件记录，不因此认定材料不足。","missing_facts":["以争议不属于 Art.24 专属管辖，且乙不属于需适用 Art.26(2) 特别告知保障的受保护被告为条件。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction"],"accepted_forum_types":["appearance"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.24"],"review_source_stage":"C2_JOINT_CONSENSUS"}
{"id":27,"cluster_id":"CL-025","conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":true,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(1)"}],"reasoning":"仅为提出管辖异议而出庭不会产生应诉管辖；但本行其余事实不足，不能确定应由何法院审理。","missing_facts":["本行不得从上一案继受当事人、合同或受诉法院事实；缺少完整争议与其他连接点。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Abstain_Insufficient_Info"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":[],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(1)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":28,"cluster_id":"CL-026","conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":true,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.28(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.28(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.28(3)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.28(4)"}],"reasoning":"缺席本身不赋予管辖；法院须先依条例确认自身管辖，并保障被告有充分时间安排抗辩。","missing_facts":["缺少被告住所、案由、与西班牙的管辖连接点及送达或实际知悉情况。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Abstain_Insufficient_Info"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":[],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.28(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.28(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.28(3)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.28(4)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":29,"cluster_id":"CL-027","conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"法国法院","forum_type":"exclusive","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":false,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.24(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.27"}],"reasoning":"即使乙未异议，西班牙法院也不能以应诉排除法国不动产所在地的专属管辖。","missing_facts":[],"accepted_conclusions":["Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction"],"accepted_forum_types":["exclusive"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.24(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.24(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.27"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":30,"cluster_id":"CL-028","conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":true,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.26(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.18(2)"}],"reasoning":"受保护消费者为被告时，未异议不足以自动产生应诉管辖；法院须先确保其获告知异议权及后果。","missing_facts":["缺少消费者住所及法院是否履行 Art.26(2) 告知义务；法国国籍本身不能替代住所。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Abstain_Insufficient_Info"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":[],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.26(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.18(2)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
