{"id":41,"cluster_id":"CL-008","conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"爱尔兰都柏林法院","forum_type":"agreement","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":false,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.25(1)"}],"reasoning":"书面条款明确授予都柏林法院管辖；即使未写明“专属”，Art.25(1) 仍推定协议管辖为专属，除非当事人另有约定。","missing_facts":[],"accepted_conclusions":["Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction"],"accepted_forum_types":["agreement"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.25(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.25(1)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":42,"cluster_id":"CL-031","conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"荷兰法院","forum_type":"general","alternative_forum_types":["special","agreement"],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.4(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.17(1)(c)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.18(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.19"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.25(1)"}],"reasoning":"双方按本案语境共同将“荷兰商家乙”理解为乙在荷兰具有本条例意义上的住所；该解释可依 Art.4(1) 确定荷兰法院的一般管辖，但不能单独确定阿姆斯特丹的国内地域管辖。消费者特别管辖是否成立取决于 Art.17(1)(c) 的定向经营条件；若消费者规则不适用，电子选择法院条款仅在符合 Art.25 的形式及实质有效性要求时才可能成立。因此 general 为主要类型，special 与 agreement 为条件性备选。","missing_facts":["需确认乙的商业或专业活动是否依 Art.17(1)(c) 定向至法国。若消费者管辖规则适用，诉前排他性选择法院条款须符合 Art.19，并受 Art.25(4) 限制；若消费者规则不适用，则需确认电子选择法院条款符合 Art.25(1)-(2) 的形式要求及 Art.25(1) 的实质有效性要求。具体由阿姆斯特丹法院受理，还须具有荷兰国内地域管辖依据或有效的阿姆斯特丹选择法院协议。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction"],"accepted_forum_types":["general","special","agreement"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.4(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.4(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.17(1)(c)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.18(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.19","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.25(1)"],"review_source_stage":"C2_JOINT_CONSENSUS"}
{"id":43,"cluster_id":"CL-011","conclusion":"Stay_for_first_seised","forum":"德国法院（先受理）；西班牙法院中止","forum_type":"lis_pendens","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":false,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(3)"}],"reasoning":"同一合同、同一当事人的赔偿之诉与消极确认属于镜像诉讼；西班牙后受理法院应中止。参见 C-406/92, Tatry。","missing_facts":[],"accepted_conclusions":["Stay_for_first_seised"],"accepted_forum_types":["lis_pendens"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(3)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":44,"cluster_id":"CL-013","conclusion":"May_stay_or_decline_for_related_actions","forum":"法国法院（后受理法院）","forum_type":"related_actions","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":false,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.30(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.30(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.30(3)"}],"reasoning":"两案当事人和请求不同，不适用 Art.29 的强制 lis pendens；但依 Art.30(3) 属相关诉讼。法国法院可依 Art.30(1) 酌情中止；因先受理诉讼仍在一审、意大利法院对两案均有管辖且可合并审理，并已有当事人申请，法国法院还可依 Art.30(2) 放弃管辖。","missing_facts":[],"accepted_conclusions":["May_stay_or_decline_for_related_actions"],"accepted_forum_types":["related_actions"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.30(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.30(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.30(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.30(3)"],"review_source_stage":"D1_JOINT_RECONFIRMATION"}
{"id":45,"cluster_id":"CL-012","conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":true,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(2)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(3)"}],"reasoning":"奥地利先受理法院否认管辖，只说明 Art.29 的 lis pendens 中止理由可不再阻碍比利时程序；并不因此自动产生比利时法院管辖权，需另有 Art.4、Art.7、Art.25 等独立依据。","missing_facts":["缺少比利时法院自身管辖基础，以及奥地利法院无管辖权裁定是否已使先受理程序障碍完全消失的程序状态。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Abstain_Insufficient_Info"],"accepted_forum_types":["none"],"required_evidence":[],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(2)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(3)"],"review_source_stage":"A1_C1_AGREEMENT"}
{"id":46,"cluster_id":"CL-014","conclusion":"Stay_for_first_seised","forum":"法国法院为先受理法院；意大利法院中止","forum_type":"lis_pendens","alternative_forum_types":[],"conditional_answer":true,"explicit_abstention":false,"legal_basis":[{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(1)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.29(3)"},{"instrument":"BRUSSELS_I_BIS","provision":"Art.32(1)"}],"reasoning":"两案涉及同一当事人和同一诉因；以法国法院按 Art.32(1) 较早受理且原告完成必要后续步骤为条件，意大利后受理法院应依 Art.29(1) 中止，并在法国法院管辖权确立后依 Art.29(3) 拒绝管辖。","missing_facts":["法国较早登记须对应 Art.32(1) 的文书提交或送达机关收件时间，且原告随后未怠于完成必要送达或提交步骤。"],"accepted_conclusions":["Stay_for_first_seised"],"accepted_forum_types":["lis_pendens"],"required_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(1)"],"accepted_evidence":["BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(1)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.29(3)","BRUSSELS_I_BIS:Art.32(1)"],"review_source_stage":"C2_JOINT_CONSENSUS"}
